### 1. 登录接口（获取 sessionId）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNo": "6222020000000001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 账户信息查询接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/accounts/profile?sessionId=REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID

### 3. 完整账户信息查询接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/accounts/full-info?sessionId=REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID

### 4. 余额查询接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/accounts/balance?sessionId=REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID

### 5. 交易前身份和账户校验接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/accounts/validate-transaction?sessionId=REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID

### 6. 取款接口（成功后记录 transactionId，可用于第 9 步查询详情）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID",
  "amount": 100,
  "printReceipt": false
}

### 7. 存款接口（成功后记录 transactionId，可用于第 9 步查询详情）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID",
  "amount": 200,
  "printReceipt": false
}

### 8. 转账接口（演示目标账户：ACC20001）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID",
  "targetAccountNo": "ACC20001",
  "amount": 100,
  "printReceipt": false
}

### 9. 交易流水查询接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/history?sessionId=REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID&page=1&size=5

### 10. 交易详情查询接口（替换为第 6、7 或 8 步返回的 transactionId）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID

### 11. 交易凭条查询接口（替换为第 6、7 或 8 步返回的 transactionId）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/receipts/REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID?sessionId=REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID

### 12. 设备状态查询接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/atm/device/status

### 13. 吐钞能力检查接口
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/device/cash-check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000
}

### 14. 余额不足验证示例
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID",
  "targetAccountNo": "ACC20001",
  "amount": 9000,
  "printReceipt": false
}

### 15. 目标账户不存在验证示例
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID",
  "targetAccountNo": "ACC99999",
  "amount": 100,
  "printReceipt": false
}

### 16. 修改密码接口（成功后当前 sessionId 失效，需要重新登录）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID",
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "654321"
}

### 17. 退出登录接口
POST http://localhost:8080/api/atm/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID"
}
